r. Oz wants to do it. But look, I think this is a prime opportunity for Democrats. If we win Ohio, if Democrats win Ohio, that is an extraordinary night. Fetterman is someone that they think has a good chance, and I think will debate.\par \par \uc2 BAIER: Really quickly.\par \par \uc2 HEMINGWAY: He has to debate. The Senate position requires him to. I thought Oz handled it well in your interview. He said he would be willing to work in any way with any restrictions that Fetterman needs because of his stroke.\par \par \uc2 BAIER: Panel, thanks. We're going to have to hold Winners and Losers because we had lot to jam in this show. But thank you very much. Jason, thank you.\par \par \uc2 It's Friday. We will get in "Notable Quotables."\par \par \uc2 (BEGIN VIDEO CLIP)\par \par \uc2 UNIDENTIFIED MALE: Buckingham Palace announced death of her majesty Queen Elizabeth II.\par \par \uc2 JOE BIDEN\uc2 , (D) PRESIDENT OF THE UNITED STATES: She was an incredibly and decent woman.\par \par \uc2 UNIDENTIFIED FEMALE: Our country has grown and flourished under her reign.\par \par \uc2 PETER DOOCY, FOX NEWS CORRESPONDENT: Well, here we go. You tweeted Trump stole an election. You tweeted \uc2 Brian Kemp\uc2  stole an election. If denying election results is extreme now, why wasn't it then?\par \par \uc2 KARINE JEAN-PIERRE\uc2 , WHITE HOUSE DEPUTY PRESS SECRETARY: So, let's be really clear. That, that comparison that you made is just ridiculous.\par \par \uc2 BIDEN: Maga Republicans, the extreme right, the, the, the Trumpies.\par \par \uc2 REP. JIM JORDAN, (R-OH) HOUSE OVERSIGHT COMMITTEE RANKING MEMBER: And you've got to call your opposition names when you got nothing else to point to.\par \par \uc2 BIDEN: No, no, no, no, no, no, no, no, no. Don't -- let -- let him go -- look. Everybody is entitled to be an idiot.\par \par \uc2 BAIER: Do you wish you went to the meat aisle and picked up a steak or called it a vegetable platter?\par \par \uc2 DR. MEHMET OZ, (R) PENNSYLVANIA SENATE CANDIDATE: I'm proud of many of the things I do.\par \par \uc2 UNIDENTIFIED FEMALE: She led this country with great reverence and duty and respect and honor, and I just don't know if there will be another like her.\par \par \uc2 (APPLAUSE)\par \par \uc2 (MUSIC)\par \par \uc2 KING CHARLES III\uc2 , UNITED KINGDOM: My life will, of course, change as I take up my new responsibilities. But I know this important work will go on.\par \par \uc2 (END VIDEO CLIP)\par \par \uc2 BAIER: SPECIAL REPORT will go on, fair, balanced and unafraid. Make it a great weekend. "JESSE WATTERS PRIMETIME" starts right now. Hey, Jesse.\par \par \uc2 END\par \par \uc2 Content and Programming Copyright 2022 Fox News Network, LLC. ALL  RIGHTS RESERVED. Copyright 2022 VIQ Media Transcription, Inc.  All  materials herein are protected by United States copyright law and may not  be reproduced, distributed, transmitted, displayed, published or broadcast  without the prior written permission of VIQ Media Transcription, Inc. You  may not alter or remove any trademark, copyright or other notice from  copies of the content. \par \par \uc2 Document FNSPBB0020220910ei9900001\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 News; Domestic\par \b \uc2 Rep. \uc2 Lauren Boebert\uc2  (R-CO) Interviewed On President Biden's Speech Denouncing MAGA Republicans; Arizona Republican Senate Candidate \uc2 Blake Masters\uc2  Interviewed On His Campaign Against Democratic Incumbent Mark Kelly; World Professional Association For Transgender Health May Lower Age Recommendations For Breast Removal To 15 Years Old And Genital Surgery To 17 Years Old; DOJ Prosecuting Trump Through Media Leaks; Surprise! More Raid Leaks From "People Familiar"; Author Of WAPO "Bombshell" Fuzzy On Details; DOJ Working Behind The Scenes To Damage Trump; Judge: Medical & Tax Docs Seized During Trump Raid; Media Unhinged Over Judge's Special Master Order; Judge's Ruling Questions Lakes To The Media; Trump Scores Win With Special Master Ruling; The Biden DOJ Targets His P