we show that 47 and 47 would vote Democrat and Republican in power.\par \par \uc2 BAIER: All right, we'll leave it on that. Panel, thank you.\par \par \uc2 Finally tonight, a SPECIAL REPORT salute.\par \par \uc2 (BEGIN VIDEO CLIP)\par \par \uc2 WISGUERE DORMEVIL: He was like, there is a baby in there. There is a baby in there. And after that, I looked down. I see the baby sticking out.\par \par \uc2 (END VIDEO CLIP)\par \par \uc2 BAIER: After seeing a flipped car on the highway, a bystander in Flagler Beach, Florida, called 911, then quickly jumped into the action. The man lifting the jeep enough so the baby boy could be safely removed from the vehicle. Never skip a leg day. Nicely done.\par \par \uc2 Thanks for inviting us into your home tonight. That's it for the SPECIAL REPORT, fair, balanced, and unafraid. Jesse, take it away.\par \par \uc2 END\par \par \uc2 Content and Programming Copyright 2022 Fox News Network, LLC. ALL  RIGHTS RESERVED. Copyright 2022 VIQ Media Transcription, Inc.  All  materials herein are protected by United States copyright law and may not  be reproduced, distributed, transmitted, displayed, published or broadcast  without the prior written permission of VIQ Media Transcription, Inc. You  may not alter or remove any trademark, copyright or other notice from  copies of the content. \par \par \uc2 Document FNSPBB0020220707ei7600001\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 News; Domestic\par \b \uc2 Democrats and Some in the Media Are Now Calling Out President Biden's Weak Leadership, Saying That He Hasn't Done on Things That Concerns Majority of Americans Like the Rising Gas Prices, Roe v. Wade, Among Other Things; Vice President \uc2 Kamala Harris\uc2  Visited Highland Park After the July 4th Holiday Mass Shooting, and She Suggested to Ban Assault Weapons; California Governor \uc2 Gavin Newsom\uc2  Declares a War on Republican-led States Like Florida Where He Even Runs an Ad Targeting Governor \uc2 Ron DeSantis\uc2 ' Policies; Newsom Claims GOP is Taking